abstract: >-
  Heuristic dynamical architecture simulated with numpy: 32x32 density-matrix
  "membranes" under Lindblad dephasing (exact unitary step, Strang splitting), an eigenvalue-boost "crystallization
  mirror", resonance-gated binary/ternary births, an Observer reporting the
  normalized l1 coherence (Cf) and a Calibrator adapting parameters. Classical
  simulation only; not a consciousness theory, not quantum hardware, not
  biology.
